 "words": 213,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Down to the Jordan the Son of God came walking",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "John held him in the water as the river rolled along",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As soon as Jesus was baptized, he came up out of the water",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And behold, a voice from heaven said",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This is my beloved Son, in whom I am well pleased",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So through baptism we were buried with him into death",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In order that, just as Christ was raised from the dead",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "By the glory of the Father",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We too might walk in newness of life",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "On the desert road from Jerusalem a chariot was turning",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Philip told the good news about Jesus as they rode",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Look, here is water",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "What is to keep me from being baptized",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And he went on his way rejoicing down the road",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So through baptism we were buried with him into death",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In order that, just as Christ was raised from the dead",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "By the glory of the Father",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We too might walk in newness of life",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Go and make disciples of all nations",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Baptizing them in the name of the Father",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And of the Son and of the Holy Spirit",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And remember, I am with you always",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To the very end of the age",
